// .stignore - Syncthing ignore patterns for this folder (dotfiles).
//
// Mirrors every .gitignore in this tree (root + nested), flattened to
// root-relative patterns: a synced folder has exactly ONE .stignore, at its
// root, and #include cannot scope patterns to a subdirectory.
//
// Rules that matter here:
//   - All patterns are relative to the folder root.
//   - The FIRST matching pattern wins, so `!` negations are written BEFORE the
//     patterns they override.
//   - A pattern without `/` (or with a leading `**/`) matches at any depth; a
//     pattern with `/` is anchored like git's "has a separator" rule.
//   - `.stignore` itself is never synced to other devices.
//
// Deliberately NOT mirrored - dead patterns, their trees are already ignored
// wholesale (see `archived` and `pi/agent/tmp` below):
//   archived/nvim/nvim-packer-git/src/packer.nvim/.gitignore
//   pi/agent/tmp/extensions/npm/f35b2129/.gitignore

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Syncthing / OS runtime junk. `(?d)` marks them deletable so they never block
// removal of an otherwise empty directory.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
(?d).stfolder
(?d).stversions
(?d)~syncthing~*.tmp
(?d).DS_Store

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// EXCEPTION vs .gitignore - nix/roles.nix  (see ask: exception lives HERE)
// .gitignore ignores it ("local manifest, never commit"); Syncthing must not.
// The negation is kept explicit, with no matching ignore above it, so the
// intent survives future edits. Caveat: this file calls itself per-machine, so
// if two devices both edit it, Syncthing will emit a .sync-conflict-* copy
// instead of merging.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!nix/roles.nix

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// root .gitignore   (.stfolder/ and .stversions/ already covered above)
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.git
.idea
.vscode
.zed
*.netrwhist
archived
.pi
.pi-subagents
nix/result
nix/result-*
nvim/plugin/packer_compiled.lua

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// pi/.gitignore
//
// Bare-name patterns in pi/.gitignore match at ANY depth below pi/, so each is
// emitted twice: `pi/x` for the direct child and `pi/**/x` for deeper hits.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
pi/agent/install
pi/agent/sessions
pi/agent/cache
pi/agent/intercom
pi/agent/run-history.jsonl
pi/agent/.agent-browser
pi/agent/pi-hermes-memory
pi/agent/projects-memory
pi/agent/models-store.json
pi/agent/trust.json
pi/agent/pi-subagents
pi/agent/fff
pi/agent/missions
pi/agent/pi-speeed-stats.json
pi/agent/usage-extension-cache.json
pi/agent/tmp

// pi-blackhole: negation must precede the wipe of the directory
!/pi/agent/pi-blackhole/pi-blackhole-config.json
pi/agent/pi-blackhole/*

pi/agent/npm/node_modules
pi/agent/npm/package-lock.json

pi/bin
pi/**/bin
pi/context-mode
pi/**/context-mode
pi/pi-acp
pi/**/pi-acp
pi/web-search-cache
pi/**/web-search-cache
pi/exa-usage.json
pi/**/exa-usage.json
pi/pi-session-*.html
pi/**/pi-session-*.html
pi/pi-session-*.json
pi/**/pi-session-*.json

// pi/.gitignore also lists `nix/result` and `nix/result-*`; pi/nix/ no longer
// exists (the flake moved to nix/), so those are dead. Root nix/result* is
// covered above.

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// neovim/.gitignore   (same bare-name doubling rule as pi/ above)
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
neovim/tt.*
neovim/**/tt.*
neovim/foo.*
neovim/**/foo.*
neovim/*.log
neovim/**/*.log
neovim/.tests
neovim/**/.tests
neovim/.repro
neovim/**/.repro
neovim/data
neovim/**/data
neovim/debug
neovim/**/debug
neovim/doc/tags
neovim/lazy-lock.json

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// pi/agent/npm/.gitignore   (`*`, `!.gitignore`, `!package.json`)
// Negations first: only these two entries of that directory are synced.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!/pi/agent/npm/.gitignore
!/pi/agent/npm/package.json
/pi/agent/npm/*

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// nono/profiles/pi.generated.json
// Rendered per machine by scripts/nono-profile-render.sh: the rollback
// exclusions nono will not expand itself, resolved to this machine's absolute
// paths. Syncing it would replace another machine's render with paths that do
// not exist there, and the next rebuild would only fix it back.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
nono/profiles/pi.generated.json
nono/profiles/pi.generated.json.tmp
